{"4029740":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Puppergeist","steam_appid":4029740,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doggie Underworld: A Rhythmic Journey<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Claire, a witch who journeys into the mysterious Doggie Underworld with one simple goal: Finding her lost Pup!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel through Doggie Underworld, you'll encounter countless souls, each with a story to tell. Share moments with them, play together, and listen to their heartfelt tales. Use your sense of rhythm to lift their spirits and ease their troubles, bringing you one beat closer to reuniting with your own lost Pup.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Heart of the Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a visual novel with rhythm mechanics, the story moves forward as you succeed in rhythm challenges. Alongside her new demon friend, Lunne, Claire learns to deepen her connection with doggie spirits, uncovering stories of friendship, love, and loss.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doggie Underworld: A Rhythmic Journey<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Claire, a witch who journeys into the mysterious Doggie Underworld with one simple goal: Finding her lost Pup!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/8d65541661fbb61a6832d9853b79a1fd.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel through Doggie Underworld, you'll encounter countless souls, each with a story to tell. Share moments with them, play together, and listen to their heartfelt tales. Use your sense of rhythm to lift their spirits and ease their troubles, bringing you one beat closer to reuniting with your own lost Pup.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/0c818afecaeb50ce775e832f593f34e3.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Heart of the Game<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a visual novel with rhythm mechanics, the story moves forward as you succeed in rhythm challenges. Alongside her new demon friend, Lunne, Claire learns to deepen her connection with doggie spirits, uncovering stories of friendship, love, and loss.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.poster.avif?t=1788284308\" width=1144 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.webm?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/extras\/84013e14370743b820b8dcdc616d2fdf.mp4?t=1788284308\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Journey through the Doggie Underworld in this heartwarming rhythm visual novel. Reunite with your lost Pup by connecting with other dog spirits, learning their stories, and lifting their moods through rhythm games full of charm and challenges!","supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/61bd4edcfe96b8f158100a92fb2b11d9778fd24a\/header.jpg?t=1788284308","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/c88b73c339a288c3ea428808a089b7c17dfc20fd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788284308","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4029740\/c88b73c339a288c3ea428808a089b7c17dfc20fd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788284308","website":"https:\/\/serenityforge.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo @ 2.00 GHz or equivalent or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel® HD Graphics or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2025 Serenity Forge LLC. Serenity Forge™ and the related logo are trademarks of Serenity Forge LLC. All rights reserved.","developers":["Serenity Forge"],"publishers":["Serenity Forge","Mecrew Games"],"demos":[{"appid":4040970,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":499,"discount_percent":0,"init